and I was so about it.

00:20:02.060 --> 00:20:04.310
- Shared universe, your
boy Kevin Feige, maybe.

00:20:04.310 --> 00:20:07.040
- Except for Pixar, Pixar
always references each other,

00:20:07.040 --> 00:20:08.375
but Disney proper, right?
- Yeah!

00:20:08.375 --> 00:20:10.060
