that threw me a little.

00:20:24.668 --> 00:20:25.910
- That was from the stage play by the way,

00:20:25.910 --> 00:20:29.162
too, since, you know...
- I stand corrected!

00:20:29.162 --> 00:20:30.410
- That was from the stage play too,

00:20:30.410 --> 00:20:32.340
I don't wanna go down all of the like,

00:20:32.340 --> 00:20:34.360
me and Joel later over
some wine, we'll be like,

00:20:34.360 --> 00:20:35.490
and this was from the stage play,

00:20:35.490 --> 00:20:36.790
and that was from the stage play.

00:20:36.790 --> 00:20:39.420
But that was a direct pull,
when I talked to Jon Favreau,

00:20:39.420 --> 00:20:41.020
