00:20:50.280 --> 00:20:53.140
they made that in-joke,
like in the live-action,

00:20:53.140 --> 00:20:54.990
sorry, in the stage Lion
King they make that joke,

00:20:54.990 --> 00:20:57.490
and so he brought over the
Beauty and the Beast one

00:20:57.490 --> 00:20:59.380
