00:20:59.380 --> 00:21:02.490
- So because Jacqueline is
our resident Broadway expert,

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:03.980
did you see anything in this Lion King

00:21:03.980 --> 00:21:05.620
that you were like, oh that's definitely,

00:21:05.620 --> 00:21:07.290
I recognize that from the stage play,

00:21:07.290 --> 00:21:09.310
and I'm happy the did it.
- Yes, first of all,

00:21:09.310 --> 00:21:11.730
the Sarabi-Scar thing is directly ripped

00:21:11.730 --> 00:21:13.520
