00:21:19.250 --> 00:21:21.170
Not even a slacker, it was he doesn't

00:21:21.170 --> 00:21:23.040
have his stuff together in the stage play.

00:21:23.040 --> 00:21:24.770
Slacker's probly the
wrong word, that was more

00:21:24.770 --> 00:21:27.780
