for me, I loved that part of it.

00:22:51.170 --> 00:22:54.260
The opening, the very first
shot of this movie was

00:22:54.260 --> 00:22:55.770
actually the only one
that wasn't animated.

00:22:55.770 --> 00:22:59.750
It was an actual shot of
