00:23:54.943 --> 00:23:57.290
But I couldn't get over it, but I thought

00:23:57.290 --> 00:23:58.580
Just Can't Wait to Be King was good,

00:23:58.580 --> 00:24:01.970
as I said, Can You Feel the
Love Tonight had its moments.

00:24:01.970 --> 00:24:03.310
- Yeah I think it had
its moments for sure,

00:24:03.310 --> 00:24:05.380
I'm glad you brought up
Can't Wait to Be King

00:24:05.380 --> 00:24:08.003
