00:25:29.540 --> 00:25:32.340
I'm all about it, don't get angry at me.

00:25:32.340 --> 00:25:34.720
And The Little Mermaid,
not only am I excited

00:25:34.720 --> 00:25:36.792
that Rob Marshall I
believe is directing it,

00:25:36.792 --> 00:25:38.960
and I thought he did an
amazing job with Mary Poppins,

00:25:38.960 --> 00:25:40.763
justice for Mary Poppins Returns,

00:25:40.763 --> 00:25:42.711
such a great and underrated film.

00:25:42.711 --> 00:25:44.970
But he's directing it and we've got,

00:25:44.970 --> 00:25:45.930
it's set in the Caribbean,
- Yes.

00:25:45.930 --> 00:25:47.890
- it's very distinctly
set in the Caribbean,

00:25:47.890 --> 00:25:49.470
