changes from the original.

00:25:51.850 --> 00:25:53.580
So I'm both excited
about those, and I have

00:25:53.580 --> 00:25:56.040
no issue with them remaking these films.

00:25:56.040 --> 00:25:59.210
The Lion King is a remake
of Hamlet, which has

00:25:59.210 --> 00:26:01.360
