times throughout the years.

00:26:01.360 --> 00:26:04.310
Aladdin, Disney did not come
up with the Aladdin story.

00:26:04.310 --> 00:26:06.930
They have a right to retell these stories,

00:26:06.930 --> 00:26:09.550
