that in The Lion King,

00:26:15.330 --> 00:26:18.235
I didn't find it adequately enough for me.

00:26:18.235 --> 00:26:20.900
Keep going, I'm like,
do your worst. (scoffs)

00:26:20.900 --> 00:26:22.850
- Do they wanna give us
reason to go to the theater

00:26:22.850 --> 00:26:25.170
