00:26:29.220 --> 00:26:30.390
Then you have Sword in the Stone,

00:26:30.390 --> 00:26:31.570
which is also in production, Maude.

00:26:31.570 --> 00:26:33.030
- Oh that was my childhood right there.

00:26:33.030 --> 00:26:34.587
- I love Sword in the Stone.
- (mumbles) oh my God, Merlin!

00:26:34.587 --> 00:26:37.110
- Those are gonna be the
more successful properties

00:26:37.110 --> 00:26:38.570
because I think Disney needs to go away

00:26:38.570 --> 00:26:40.760
