Aladdins, the Lion Kings,

00:26:40.760 --> 00:26:42.600
the Little Mermaids, although
I think it'll be great.

00:26:42.600 --> 00:26:43.860
They need to get away from these things

00:26:43.860 --> 00:26:45.810
