00:26:45.810 --> 00:26:47.604
into the smaller parts
(Mark drowns her out).

00:26:47.604 --> 00:26:48.720
- Go with some B-side.
- Yeah, go with some B-side,

00:26:48.720 --> 00:26:50.750
give me some Lady and the
Tramp, which is great,

00:26:50.750 --> 00:26:52.410
but can't compare that to The Lion King,

00:26:52.410 --> 00:26:54.390
can't compare Sword in the
Stone to Beauty and the Beast.

00:26:54.390 --> 00:26:55.740
