- (coughing) Money.

00:27:23.772 --> 00:27:26.750
You've got it, you've taken my money, man,

00:27:26.750 --> 00:27:29.190
here, Disney, have it all, I'll watch it.

00:27:29.190 --> 00:27:31.410
Again, I don't think that
it's fair to blanket anything

00:27:31.410 --> 00:27:32.953
