I would be willing to bet

00:28:13.470 --> 00:28:15.102
Disney+ is one of 'em.
- Yeah, for sure.

00:28:15.102 --> 00:28:16.548
- Were you excited about the new Mulan,

00:28:16.548 --> 00:28:17.740
really quick before we say goodnight?

00:28:17.740 --> 00:28:19.123
- 100%.
- Yeah.

00:28:19.123 --> 00:28:20.279
